After building, provide a concise explanation of the implemented features, how to run the project, whether a backend/database is connected, and which features still require configuration.

**Final goal:** Create a polished, attractive, fully demonstrable Community Connect platform with the Teal + Warm Yellow + Charcoal colour theme, all five working modules, a Smart Help Matcher, Kindness Points, QR donation confirmation, an Impact Dashboard, and elderly-friendly accessibility. Preserve the core purpose of the project and prioritize real functionality, privacy, accessibility, and a professional presentation.

